Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.60,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.67,0:01:15.07,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.86,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.53,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:26.79,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.98,0:01:33.76,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:38.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:40.43,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:44.81,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.48,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)}making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:04.70,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:07.04,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.23,0:02:11.38,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.71,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.71,0:02:17.88,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:20.18,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.54,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:27.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:38.56,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000)}乂洛娜的恐怖！\N騙人布VS幽靈公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:42.35,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.35,0:02:46.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你怎麼能飛？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:48.94,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好有自信啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你剛才明明還在逃跑...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:54.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎麼突然變了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.59,0:03:01.20,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我剛才有點分心而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.73,0:03:07.03,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我從沒想過會有人對消極幽靈免疫。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.58,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我只有一件事要告訴你...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:13.19,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,振作起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:14.27,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.97,0:03:18.51,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你能飛又怎樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.90,0:03:20.37,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我可是狙擊手！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:22.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不管你是飛還是跳舞，我才不在乎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:24.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,容我說明！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.42,0:03:29.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我的新武器獨角仙靠著這五根軸同時獲得了射程和穩定性！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:34.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,在發射瞬間啟動我從空島得到的風貝，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:40.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,就能讓彈丸旋轉，產生各種速度變化，造就超級彈珠台！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.10,0:03:43.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,火焰、閃光、衝擊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:47.37,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,只要更換貝殼，就能讓彈丸更強！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:50.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒人能逃過它的能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:55.17,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好了，準備-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:57.75,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她不見了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:59.18,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,跑哪去了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:01.92,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你後面。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.10,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,趕快試著打我啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:16.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你、你到底是什麼東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你這...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:22.19,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:23.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鳳蝶流星！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:27.78,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她恢復正常了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:32.70,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.70,0:04:34.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我要把你射下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}螳螂流星！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:50.54,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,她的手正在穿進我的身體裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:51.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,怎、怎麼可能？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:54.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我竟然沒感到痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.55,0:04:55.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:59.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,已經... 完了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.82,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你這笨蛋，仔細看清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:02.96,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,沒有外傷。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:06.49,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,我的手只是在你身體裡面而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:10.87,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,代表你的死期已到。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:16.71,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,現在，我要親手...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:18.94,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,捏碎你的心臟。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:20.95,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:23.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,請住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:25.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那樣我真的會死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.18,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我就是要殺了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:30.15,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,好了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:33.27,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,在劇烈的痛苦中死去吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:36.20,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.20,0:05:38.45,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,拜託住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:39.77,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我不想...！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:44.28,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,當然我做不到那種事啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:46.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,虛張聲勢？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\move(640,700,640,643,700,1100)}我撞到頭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:51.00,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,如果我有能力造成像捏碎那樣的物理傷害...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:49.36,Secondary,Usopp,0,0,0,,我撞到頭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:54.50,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,在我的手穿進你身體的瞬間你就已經死了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.21,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不管怎樣，這對心臟都不好。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:01.71,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我剛才只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.20,0:06:03.69,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,穿過了你的身體。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:11.39,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,儘管你能清楚地看到我...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:15.16,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我的身體可以穿過任何東西。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:16.86,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,150)}六連蝮蛇星！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.28,0:06:27.63,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我不是剛告訴你我可以穿過任何東西嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.12,0:06:32.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.87,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好噁心！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:37.73,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,換句話說，你的攻擊打不到我。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:41.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.11,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,走開！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.87,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:45.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不要過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:47.11,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,走開啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:53.02,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你現在要怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:55.26,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你的攻擊沒有效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.46,0:06:58.16,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:02.02,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你剛才說要捏碎我心臟那是虛張聲勢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:06.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那樣的話，你也碰不到我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.69,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你也無法攻擊我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.69,0:07:11.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你攻擊不了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:12.51,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,對吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:14.42,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}迷你幽靈...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:17.29,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那、那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.46,0:07:21.05,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,50)}幽靈饒舌...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:28.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,牆、牆壁...！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:30.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,爆、爆炸...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:34.39,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,走開！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:36.47,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,50)}饒舌...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:40.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你這混蛋...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:41.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:42.43,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火鳥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.57,0:07:50.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.34,0:07:52.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這也太犯規了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:55.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我無法攻擊她！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.49,0:07:57.42,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但她卻能攻擊我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:58.72,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這是什麼對戰組合啊？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:03.00,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,讓、讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:04.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我看不到前面。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:05.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.85,0:08:16.23,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}幽靈饒舌...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.49,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,這是...？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:29.57,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,真丟臉...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:35.74,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,我還以為那個女人比我弱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:41.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,熊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.61,0:08:42.82,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,小心，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:46.17,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,乂瑪西的力量超過了普通的熊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.17,0:08:53.06,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:57.57,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,船員裡沒有人能對抗那個女人的能力...！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:09:01.31,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,她本來應該是只有我才能打倒的對手...！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:04.00,Flashbacks,Usopp,0,0,0,,你不行...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:07.31,Flashbacks,Usopp,0,0,0,,以你那點能力不可能打敗她。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.29,0:09:16.45,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,這本來應該是我的機會... 但看看我現在這副樣子...！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.32,0:09:18.29,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒用了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.05,0:09:20.96,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒用了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.54,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,我根本沒有勝算！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:29.61,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果我在這裡被打倒，她就會去抓魯夫和其他人，那整個船員就完了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:35.22,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,拯救他們的負擔比我想的還要重...！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.95,0:09:37.34,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,救救我...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.65,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,救救我...！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.19,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,狙擊王！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:50.52,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,請告訴我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.29,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,你會怎麼做？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:10:01.25,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, the wind carries my name
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:05.10,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}from Sniper Island far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:08.60,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}When I take aim, it is straight and true,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:11.00,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}lu lu la la lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.90,0:10:13.75,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}Whether you're a man or a mouse:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.75,0:10:15.20,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lock on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.20,0:10:17.95,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}I will put your heart in my sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.95,0:10:21.30,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}Lock on!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:29.07,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\an8}The man who came from the Sniper Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.07,0:10:32.65,Jungle P lyrics,Song,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500}{\an8}Lu lu lu lu lu la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:03.60,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,乂瑪西！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:04.73,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:09.55,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你！竟敢傷害我的乂瑪西..！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:13.42,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,那個蠢面具是什麼東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:18.05,Main,Sogeking,0,0,0,,一點都不蠢！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.05,0:10:19.95,Main,Sogeking,0,0,0,,初次見面！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:22.24,Main,Sogeking,0,0,0,,我的名字是狙擊王！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.24,0:10:23.90,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,別把我當笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:25.68,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你以為我會相信你是別人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.85,0:10:28.04,Main,Sogeking,0,0,0,,是時候跑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.04,0:10:29.69,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,現在又跑？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.75,0:10:31.90,Thoughts,Sogeking,0,0,0,,冷靜下來！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.90,0:10:33.59,Thoughts,Sogeking,0,0,0,,戰鬥吧，騙人布君！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:34.67,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,閉嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:35.97,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,沒用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.97,0:10:38.03,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,我完全贏不了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.44,Thoughts,Sogeking,0,0,0,,那不是真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:41.30,Thoughts,Sogeking,0,0,0,,你是唯一能做到的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.79,0:10:43.95,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,你有什麼根據嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:45.43,Thoughts,Sogeking,0,0,0,,沒有。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.43,0:10:47.93,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,果然沒有！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.59,0:10:49.63,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}迷你幽靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:53.51,Thoughts,Sogeking,0,0,0,,冷靜想想。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:55.75,Thoughts,Sogeking,0,0,0,,那個女人一定有什麼可疑之處。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:57.74,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,的確是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:00.61,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,那個女人突然變得那麼有自信。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:05.03,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,一開始她怕我然後逃跑了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:12.23,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果她對我的攻擊免疫的話，她根本不需要逃跑。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.67,0:11:16.09,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,她可以飛或者穿牆。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:19.76,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,但她卻哭著跑掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:20.59,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}饒舌！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.59,0:11:21.47,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}饒舌！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.02,0:11:27.99,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,在我跟丟那個女人的瞬間...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:31.44,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,發生了什麼事...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:35.42,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,我在跟熊交手的時候...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:41.22,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,就是那時候我一瞬間失去了她的蹤影。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:46.36,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,那麼，差不多該帶你去見乂利亞大人了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.67,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,就是這個！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:49.35,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,我破解了...！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:54.31,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,附近有沒有可疑的地方...？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:57.68,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,比如密室之類的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:12:01.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你的把戲！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:04.44,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,那是什麼？你的遺言嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:08.76,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:09.91,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,你在瞄哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:13.89,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,就是那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.89,0:12:14.88,Main,Perona,0,0,0,,喂，等等！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:17.49,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺巨人甲蟲流星！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:28.60,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,找到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.91,0:12:35.48,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那才是你的真身！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.71,0:12:42.33,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果你能飛，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:44.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,能穿牆穿過人...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.56,0:12:47.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,還能隨意從大變小...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:51.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那代表你的身體是幽靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:56.94,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,但是想到你之前逃跑的樣子...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.68,0:13:00.17,Flashbacks,Pelona,0,0,0,,不要過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.17,0:13:04.63,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那時候你是用肉身在跑的！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.63,0:13:05.76,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你什麼-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:06.84,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,也就是說！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:09.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,眼前的這個人...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:12.79,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,只不過是你趁我沒注意時創造出來的幽靈。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你一直把真身藏在裡面！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:16.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你再也無法隱瞞了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:21.51,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我還以為你只是個消極的白痴...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.51,0:13:23.99,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你從那個蠢面具裡得到了勇氣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:27.66,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你能看穿讓我很意外。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:30.00,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,但你只答對了百分之九十...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:33.52,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我不是能被身體控制的幽靈...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:38.02,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,而是透過靈體出竅從身體分離出來的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:41.63,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,一個能自主思考和行動的虛空體。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.99,0:13:43.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,原來如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:46.13,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那麼，如果沒有身體可以回去的話，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:48.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不知道你會怎麼樣呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:52.66,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你一定會叫我別攻擊它的，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:54.77,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,混蛋！住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:56.12,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:57.58,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}大爆炸星！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.60,0:14:04.38,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,好險...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:07.13,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你射偏了，而且那還是啞彈。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:08.59,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,再一發！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.11,0:14:10.87,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我怎麼會讓你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.03,0:14:12.16,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}特大幽靈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.16,0:14:14.93,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這是...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:16.58,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}迷你幽靈...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.71,0:14:21.21,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那些東西的超大版本？！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.27,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這下糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:25.88,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,放開我，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:27.41,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,掙扎一陣子吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:29.80,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我不會讓你碰到我的真身。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.28,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那些飯糰大小的幽靈就已經造成瘋狂的傷害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:37.68,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果這個超級巨大的東西爆炸，我的身體會被炸成碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:40.20,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,不管你怎麼掙扎都碰不到它的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:41.23,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,它是幽靈。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.09,0:14:52.83,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,放開！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:55.08,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,放開我啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:15:00.22,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,真可惜啊，消極鼻子。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.22,0:15:04.25,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我彈個手指，你的身體就會被炸成碎片。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:05.59,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}神風饒舌！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:11.72,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,消失了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,好險。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:17.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你的攻擊現在在這個貝殼裡面了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:19.41,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你什麼-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:21.81,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我動不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.81,0:15:23.02,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,這是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:27.26,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我剛才射向你的大爆炸星是假的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.26,0:15:28.93,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那不是啞彈...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:30.99,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,是我的黏著劑。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:34.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這樣的話，就算你回到真身也無法動彈。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.19,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:39.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,現在我可以同時解決你的本體和虛空體了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:41.04,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:45.15,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,你就是淨化乂瑪西指揮官的老鼠？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.56,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,來得正好！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:49.28,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,上吧，副指揮官乂乂河馬！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.05,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}衝擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:57.16,Thoughts,Pelona,0,0,0,,這傢伙... 真的那麼強嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:15:59.71,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:02.87,Thoughts,Usopp,0,0,0,,我的手臂要斷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:06.25,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,乂乂河馬！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.27,0:16:09.03,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:10.99,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黑光星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:22.17,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,蟑螂！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:23.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,又叫做蟑螂星。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:25.29,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,噁心！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.38,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,誰來把牠們弄掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:29.86,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:33.17,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我動不了了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:36.34,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,牠爬進我衣服裡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:37.94,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我最討厭蟑螂了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.29,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,好怕，好害怕！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:40.40,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,乂瑪西！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:46.31,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,別被幾隻蟑螂嚇成那樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.85,0:16:49.61,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你真正的噩夢是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:51.80,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:56.24,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你太小看我了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.69,0:17:01.38,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我可是東海最有名的超級力量男！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.70,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,十、十噸...？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:05.79,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,喂、喂，你那力氣從哪來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:07.57,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,住、住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:09.34,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我不可能撐得住那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:15.53,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,那會死人的，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.53,0:17:17.38,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,把蟑螂拿走！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:18.48,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,把那個鐵鎚也拿走！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:20.14,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,把蟑螂和鐵鎚都拿走，拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.67,0:17:25.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\pos(585,702)}騙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.17,0:17:25.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,150)\pos(621,702)}人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:25.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,150)\pos(676,702)}布...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.25,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.25,0:17:31.63,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,我再也不會碰你的同伴了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:32.45,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,真的！真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.45,0:17:34.44,Main,Pelona,0,0,0,,拜託了！拜託了！騙人布大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:36.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}黃金...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:40.30,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}重擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:58.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,所以說，鬼屋的公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:05.52,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,竟然會因為一個氣球和幾隻玩具蟑螂而昏倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.13,0:18:10.90,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你搞錯了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:15.07,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,如果你以為能在消極和謊言的對決中贏過我的話！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:19.55,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,做個好夢，直到天亮吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:46.13,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那個武士剛才是不是說了什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.50,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,換句話說...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:53.26,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,這代表什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:55.32,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,代表...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:58.34,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,比賽結束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:02.34,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我從沒見過這種戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.12,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那個武士...！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:08.75,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,根本沒把我當回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.44,0:19:18.30,Captions,Note,0,0,200,,{\an8\pos(562,100)\fad(1200,0)\fs60}五分鐘前，\N乂乂乂克的研究室
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:24.22,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,所以你要拿走我那把名刀秋水？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:24.21,Note,Ryuuma,0,0,100,,秋水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:26.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,準確地說...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:30.77,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我會從你的屍體旁邊拿走那把刀。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:32.21,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,原來如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:34.09,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,你看起來很有自信嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:38.48,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,別、別挑釁他...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:42.41,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,你帶了三把刀。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.41,0:19:46.09,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,嗯，但有一把斷了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.09,0:19:48.83,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,直接丟掉感覺不對，所以我一直帶著。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.24,0:19:52.12,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,我是三刀流的使用者。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:53.79,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,三刀流？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:55.65,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,沒聽過。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.65,0:19:56.93,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,是某種特技表演嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:01.86,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,很可惜我沒辦法表演給你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:05.60,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,要不然你的鼻子早就斷了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.94,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,大概吧... 你看起來挺強的。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:12.76,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,一股陌生的感覺正在沸騰全身。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:16.61,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,就好像要面對一頭巨獸一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:20.07,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,真是奇怪的感覺。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:22.78,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,我非常興奮。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:26.87,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,嚇我一跳！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.74,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}晨歌...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.74,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}破曉小夜曲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:35.28,Main,Ryuuma,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}正面突刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:35.28,Note,Ryuma,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}直線突刺
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.26,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,手、手槍？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.45,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,突、突刺！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:45.47,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,我用那招的時候從來沒發生過那種事！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:17:22.67,0:17:25.85,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Usopp...

